  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">'태양활동이 우리에게 미치는 영향'</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Sy